{"ref":"BDB, טָֽהֳרָה","hw":"טָֽהֳרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">טָֽהֳרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. purifying, cleansing</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 12:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.12.4\">Lv 12:4</a> + 2 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">טָהֳרַת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.28\">1 Ch 23:28</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.19\">2 Ch 30:19</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">טָהֳרָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.7\">Lv 13:7</a> + 7 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>purifying, menstruation</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 12:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.12.4\">Lv 12:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 12:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.12.5\">5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>cleansing, purification</em>, of leper <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.7\">Lv 13:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.35\">35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.2\">14:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.32\">32</a>; of Nazirite <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:9\" href=\"/Numbers.6.9\">Nu 6:9</a>: from an issue <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.13\">Lv 15:13</a> (all P); from contact with the dead <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.26\">Ez 44:26</a>; of sacred things in gen. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.28\">1 Ch 23:28</a>; of persons for the passover <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.19\">2 Ch 30:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁמֶרֶת הַטָּהֳרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:45\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.45\">Ne 12:45</a> <em>the charge, requirement of purification</em>.","next":"BDB, טָהור","prev":"BDB, טֳהָר"}